    "created_at": "2016-08-26T16:15:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-26T16:15:40Z",
    "body": "Fixed the wrapping.\n\nBluetooth refers to navigate at https://webbluetoothcg.github.io/web-bluetooth/#dom-bluetooth-referringdevice, but doesn't call it. That section's awkward, and if you have better ideas for how to initialize the referring device, I'm happy to fix it.\n",
