    "created_at": "2016-08-26T17:14:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-26T17:14:48Z",
    "body": "I think we may want to add some kind of hook to initialising a Document that Bluetooth can add, e.g. \"Invoke any initialising a Document steps defined in other specifications\".\n\nI totally believe that other specs will want to reference the general concept of navigation. E.g. Fetch probably does already, right? But yeah, they shouldn't call it.\n",
